### Probar endpoints del servidor FastAPI con REST Client (VS Code)
### Requiere la extension: humao.rest-client
### Iniciar servidor primero: make server  (o F5 → "Servidor FastAPI")

@base = http://localhost:8000

# -----------------------------------------------------------------------
# Health check
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------

### Estado del servidor
GET {{base}}/health


# -----------------------------------------------------------------------
# Webhook Meta — verificacion (GET)
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------

### Verificar token de webhook (simula lo que hace Meta al registrar el webhook)
GET {{base}}/webhook?hub.mode=subscribe&hub.challenge=CHALLENGE_CODE_123&hub.verify_token=un-token-secreto-que-tu-eliges


# -----------------------------------------------------------------------
# Webhook Meta — mensajes entrantes (POST)
# Simula lo que Meta envia cuando un paciente escribe
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------

### Paciente dice "SI" (confirmar cita)
POST {{base}}/webhook
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "entry": [{
    "changes": [{
      "value": {
        "messages": [{
          "from": "56922334455",
          "id": "wamid.test001",
          "type": "text",
          "text": { "body": "Si, confirmo" }
        }]
      }
    }]
  }]
}

###

### Paciente dice "NO" (cancelar cita)
POST {{base}}/webhook
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "entry": [{
    "changes": [{
      "value": {
        "messages": [{
          "from": "56944556677",
          "id": "wamid.test002",
          "type": "text",
          "text": { "body": "No voy a poder ir" }
        }]
      }
    }]
  }]
}

###

### Paciente quiere cambiar horario
POST {{base}}/webhook
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "entry": [{
    "changes": [{
      "value": {
        "messages": [{
          "from": "56955667788",
          "id": "wamid.test003",
          "type": "text",
          "text": { "body": "Necesito cambiar mi hora" }
        }]
      }
    }]
  }]
}

###

### Paciente hace pregunta libre (va al agente Rosita)
POST {{base}}/webhook
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "entry": [{
    "changes": [{
      "value": {
        "messages": [{
          "from": "56933445566",
          "id": "wamid.test004",
          "type": "text",
          "text": { "body": "Hola, cuando es mi proxima cita?" }
        }]
      }
    }]
  }]
}

###

### Numero desconocido
POST {{base}}/webhook
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "entry": [{
    "changes": [{
      "value": {
        "messages": [{
          "from": "56999999999",
          "id": "wamid.test005",
          "type": "text",
          "text": { "body": "Hola" }
        }]
      }
    }]
  }]
}


# -----------------------------------------------------------------------
# Admin — ejecutar scheduler manualmente
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------

### Enviar confirmaciones del dia siguiente (sin esperar el cron)
POST {{base}}/admin/scheduler/run
